","notes":"Arrive after the posted opening time, view the current installation, and leave enough room to look across the adjoining plaza.","short_summary":"Make a compact, no-admission art stop on the undergraduate campus.","evidence_claim":"Lewis & Clark states that the Hoffman Gallery is free, open to the public, open daily from 11 a.m. to 4 p.m., and occupies 3,500 square feet.","source_url":"https://www.lclark.edu/hoffman_gallery/","source_title":"Ronna and Eric Hoffman Gallery of Contemporary Art","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The gallery posts daily hours of 11 a.m.–4 p.m.; confirm the current exhibition calendar before visiting.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lc-first-weekend-college-outdoors","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"College Outdoors","title":"Meet College Outdoors","subtitle":"Saturday midday · Map future weekend options","notes":"Find room 239 in Fowler, review the trip program online, and note where to ask about clinics or planning a later outing.","short_summary":"Locate the campus office that organizes recurring outdoor trips and clinics.","evidence_claim":"Lewis & Clark states that College Outdoors runs varied trips and clinics nearly every weekend during the semester and is located in Fowler Student Center room 239.","source_url":"https://www.lclark.edu/programs/college_outdoors/programs/","source_title":"Programs • College Outdoors","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Office access and participation require separate confirmation; trip registration, capacity, prerequisites, and fees may vary.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lc-first-weekend-pamplin","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Pamplin Sports Center","title"